{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22985","headline":"浔阳秋怀赠许明府 · 白居易","name":"浔阳秋怀赠许明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜红二林叶，风白九江波。\n暝色投烟鸟，秋声带雨荷。\n马闲无处出，门冷少人过。\n卤莽还乡梦，依稀望阙歌。\n共思除醉外，无计奈愁何。\n试问陶家酒，新篘得几多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}